{"text": "The project is titled 'Improve Your First Impression: The Serendipity Experiment'.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project was created by the Serendipity Team.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "team_member", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project aimed to help users understand how the world sees them and grow through feedback.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project was intended for iOS and Android platforms.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project was based in Toronto, Canada.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The funding goal for the project was $17,653.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "$240 was pledged towards the project.", "dimensions": ["strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "funding_source", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The funding period for the project was from July 24, 2014, to August 23, 2014.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The project's funding was unsuccessful as the goal was not reached.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "The last update for the project was on August 23, 2014.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "feasibility"], "type": "milestone", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 0, "char_start": 0, "char_end": 1800}}
{"text": "Serendipity is a project that focuses on improving first impressions through conversations.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Members of Serendipity engage in four-minute text-chat conversations.", "dimensions": ["strategy"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Participants in Serendipity can be adults of any age from practically everywhere on Earth.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "After each conversation, participants rank each other on appearance, individuality, and character.", "dimensions": ["strategy"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "As participants have more conversations, a clearer profile of how others perceive them emerges.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The project utilizes the strength of first impressions, perceived value, and the wisdom of the crowd.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The visual content of the project includes a circular flow with steps for improving first impressions.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The circular rating scale in the visual content indicates traits such as 'Modest,' 'Witty,' 'Smart,' and 'Shy.'", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "Participants are encouraged to use others’ ratings to improve the image they project.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 1, "char_start": 1400, "char_end": 3200}}
{"text": "The Serendipity app allows users to rank each other based on appearance, individuality, and character.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "As users have more conversations on the Serendipity app, a clearer profile of how others perceive them emerges.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The Serendipity app is designed to be a true mirror of users' images based on scientific reality.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "innovation", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Each Serendipity user remains anonymous to all other users, identified only by a pseudonym.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "Users are anonymous even to the Serendipity app itself, aside from their registration information.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The Serendipity team has been interested in the relationship between first impressions and perceived value.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The Serendipity team has read and contributed to blogs about first impressions and perceived value.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The Serendipity app compiles detailed information about how others perceive users.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The Serendipity app is part of a project that aims to improve first impressions.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The concept of the Serendipity app is influenced by the ideas presented in James Surowiecki's book, The Wisdom of the Crowds.", "dimensions": ["innovation"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "innovation", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 2, "char_start": 2800, "char_end": 4600}}
{"text": "The Serendipity app allows users to remain anonymous even to the app itself.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The creators of Serendipity have been interested in the strength of first impressions and perceived value.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The creators of Serendipity read James Surowiecki's book 'The Wisdom of the Crowds' which influenced their project.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The Serendipity app aims to help people connect with each other in a more positive way.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The Serendipity app is designed for scalability, including future integration with mobile and other applications.", "dimensions": ["strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "strategy", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The visual content of the Serendipity project includes a tablet display showing options like 'My Rating' and 'Highlights.'", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The visual content includes a world map highlighting Europe with an attractiveness score of 172.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The world view in the visual content displays a gender distribution of 35% male and 65% female.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The user age distribution in the visual content shows that 35% of users are aged 25-30.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 3, "char_start": 4200, "char_end": 6000}}
{"text": "The project is titled 'Slice and Dice the Universe of Serendipity Data'.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The age range targeted by the project is 25-30.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The project emphasizes analyzing personal perception data by gender, age, and location.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The project team is referred to as the 'Serendipity Team'.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "org_structure", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The project includes a contribution tier of $50, which provides access to a tracker, age, gender, and world.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "budget_item", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The project includes a contribution tier of $60, which provides access to a tracker, age, gender, world, and big picture.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "budget_item", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "Backers of the project will have lifetime access to their backed features.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The page lists New York, Paris, and Tokyo as attractive locations with associated attractiveness scores of 172, 109, and 26 respectively.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The project includes attributes with associated numbers: Confident (82), Smart (112), Attractive (120), and Liberal (84).", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The project indicates that 68% of the surveyed individuals are women.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "strategy", "feasibility"], "type": "market", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The visual content includes a diagram titled 'IN MY EYES'.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "'24 YEARS OLD' is noted in the diagram next to one point of a triangle.", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"suspect_numeric": false, "proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
