{"text": "The diagram includes text asking, 'WHAT DO YOU CONSIDER ATTRACTIVE?'", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The diagram also includes text stating, 'A REFLECTION OF YOUR TYPICAL PREFERENCES OR BIASES.'", "dimensions": ["objectives"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 6, "char_start": 8400, "char_end": 10200}}
{"text": "The Serendipity Experiment is a project by the Serendipity Team available on Kickstarter.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 7, "char_start": 9800, "char_end": 11600}}
