{"text": "The iOS release for the project is expected by late September.", "dimensions": ["objectives", "feasibility"], "type": "milestone", "primary_dimension": "objectives", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 7, "char_start": 9800, "char_end": 11600}}
{"text": "The fundamental risk posed by the start-up is that not enough people will participate in Serendipity.", "dimensions": ["feasibility"], "type": "risk", "primary_dimension": "feasibility", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 7, "char_start": 9800, "char_end": 11600}}
{"text": "The Serendipity Team believes that their idea is cool and that a wise crowd will gather.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 7, "char_start": 9800, "char_end": 11600}}
{"text": "The Serendipity Experiment is a project by the Serendipity Team on Kickstarter.", "dimensions": ["team"], "type": "other", "primary_dimension": "team", "meta": {"proposal_id": "kt25__openai", "chunk_index": 8, "char_start": 11200, "char_end": 13000}}
